      "data": {
        "text": "**Initiating Upload Implementation**\n\nI'm now starting on `upload_object.py`, having finished the helper files. This initial script will use `azure.storage.blob` to upload a simple object. The core functionality is the immediate focus.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789896114115,
          "start": 1789896114051
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0be1f3f8300154Zzr63kOJfID9",
