        "text": "**Initiating Download Creation**\n\nI'm now moving forward with the implementation of `presigned_download.py`. The focus will be on generating a time-limited, signed URL specifically for downloading a stored object from Azure Blob Storage. This should allow for secure and controlled access.\n\n\n",
