        "text": "**Implementing Object Metadata**\n\nI'm currently working on `object_metadata.py`, focusing on how it will interface with Azure Blob Storage. The primary function will be to read object metadata, or the head information, from managed object storage. I'm aiming for efficiency in retrieving this data.\n\n\n",
