        "text": "**Implementing List Prefix**\n\nI'm now focused on implementing `list_prefix.py` to handle listing objects under a specific prefix in Azure Blob Storage. The primary goal is to provide a robust and efficient way to retrieve objects based on their prefixes, essential for many use cases. I'm aiming for clean, well-documented code.\n\n\n",
